 <paragraph index="990" node_type="writer">Specific feature implementations</paragraph>
 <paragraph index="991" node_type="writer">Message serializer</paragraph>
 <paragraph index="992" node_type="writer">	The TAP serializer works by receiving an incomplete header and a complete payload. The following table highlights the header fields the serializer requires:</paragraph>
 <object index="993" name="Table15" object_type="table"/>
 <paragraph index="995" node_type="writer" parent_index="993">SOF_WORD</paragraph>
